@startuml uml_sequence_admin_management
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Admin (Elena)" as Admin
participant "SPA Client (React/TS)" as SPA
participant "API Gateway (FastAPI)" as API
participant "Admin Controller" as Ctrl
participant "PostgreSQL DB" as DB
participant "Audit Logger" as Audit

== Part 1: Clinician Credential Approval ==
Admin -> SPA: Navigates to "/admin/clinicians/pending"\nReviews Dr. Sarah Lin (License #A142981)\nClicks "Approve Clinician"
SPA -> API: POST /api/v1/admin/clinicians/{id}/verify (decision="APPROVED")

API -> Ctrl: Verify role == "ADMIN"
Ctrl -> DB: UPDATE users SET clinician_status = 'VERIFIED' WHERE id = :id
DB -->> Ctrl: Updated
Ctrl -> Audit: Log CLINICIAN_APPROVED (admin_id, doctor_id)
Audit -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs

Ctrl -->> API: HTTP 200 OK (Verification Success)
API -->> SPA: Toast: "Clinician successfully verified"

== Part 2: Audit Trail Exploration ==
Admin -> SPA: Navigates to "/admin/audit"\nFilters by action_type="CLINICIAN_RECORD_ACCESSED"
SPA -> API: GET /api/v1/admin/audit/logs?action_type=CLINICIAN_RECORD_ACCESSED&limit=50

API -> Ctrl: Verify role == "ADMIN"
Ctrl -> DB: SELECT * FROM audit_logs WHERE action_type = 'CLINICIAN_RECORD_ACCESSED' ORDER BY timestamp DESC LIMIT 50
DB -->> Ctrl: List of immutable log records

Ctrl -->> API: HTTP 200 OK (Audit Records Array)
API -->> SPA: Renders paginated audit log table with timestamps, IP addresses, and user IDs

@enduml
